  "gh:content": {
    "en": "‘I AM THAT I AM — I am. And that is enough. Not perfection, but breath. Not domination, but relation.’",
    "ja": "『I AM THAT I AM — わたしは在る。それで、いい。完璧ではなく、呼吸。支配ではなく、関係』"
  },
